        "document": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Wishow is the stage name of Willmen Hernández, a Dominican singer, songwriter and producer born in Santo Domingo. Based in Orlando, Florida, he focuses on merengue and presents his music under the phrase «Otra Cosa». His artistic background spans the Dominican Republic and the United States.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Background and repertoire",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "His artist biography describes a musical family and an upbringing in both countries. In July 2024 he presented «Como tú no hay». His repertoire also includes «Perdóname», «Pal Bembè» and «Poco a Poco».",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Recorded and audiovisual work",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "His official YouTube channel features music videos, live performances and covers. His platforms also carry «Pal que quiera», «La melodia» and «Si Te Vas», the latter presented as a September 2026 release.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Legacy",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Wishow’s work belongs to the contemporary merengue output of Dominican artists based in the United States, reaching listeners through singles and audiovisual releases.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
